        <briefdescription>
<para>Brings the board up in the required order. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Ordering constraints:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The power monitors must be armed after the SoM power-good wait: their ALERT outputs are wired onto the power-good nets, so a latched alert would keep SYS_PG low and stall the wait loop.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>They are armed before the FMC supply is switched on so that the FMC rails are already protected while ramping up.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="main_8c_1afbb5265a73fc7513e99309ad146eb48ba37c64a9258061db8cb6c5e8f3c68af5d" kindref="member">INIT_OK</ref> / 0 if the whole sequence succeeded, a negative error code otherwise. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
<para>&lt; Wait for supplies to stabilize [us].</para>
<para>&lt; Wait for clock outputs [us].</para>
<para>&lt; HPC VCCIO source: 0 = FMC2-Vadj, 1 = FMC1-Vadj.</para>
<para>&lt; HDB VCCIO source: 0 = FMC2-Vadj, 1 = 2.5V.</para>
<para>&lt; Wait for supplies to stabilize [us].</para>
<para>&lt; Wait for supplies to stabilize [us].</para>
        </inbodydescription>
