    <briefdescription>
<para>Board bring-up and supervision of the carrier board. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>: system controller application</para>
<para>This file only contains the CPU-level startup (trap vector, interrupt enable) and the bring-up sequence. All device handling lives in the function groups:</para>
<para><ref refid="i2cBus_8c" kindref="compound">i2cBus.c</ref> I2C controllers, interrupt controller, bus switch <ref refid="boardGpio_8c" kindref="compound">boardGpio.c</ref> named GPIO access (enables, resets, power-good lines) <ref refid="power_8c" kindref="compound">power.c</ref> FMC Vadj regulators and power monitors <ref refid="clkGen_8c" kindref="compound">clkGen.c</ref> clock generator</para>
<para>The startup configuration is in <ref refid="boardConfig_8h" kindref="compound">boardConfig.h</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
